Write a short-form video package for the idea below, following the guide above.

Provide:
- hooks: 5 options, each under 12 words, each using a different formula
- favourite_hook: the best of the five
- script: a 30-45 second spoken script (about 80-110 words): hook, the problem, the automation shown on screen, the result, call to action
- on_screen_text: one short line per beat, plus what to screen-record
- caption: under 60 words, ending with: Comment KEYWORD and I'll send you the build.
- keyword: one uppercase word, e.g. DIGEST

Rules: British English. Only claim results that are true; do not invent clients, numbers or testimonials. If the idea needs a result you can't know, show the build working instead.
